						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Boost Academic Reputation</h5>
                            <p>By aligning with a trusted, established overseas education expert, Indian universities can position themselves as top-tier institutions with global outreach.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dr. Abdul Kalam International Postgraduate Scholarship -->
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 Indian-Students-Card">
                        <img src="~/assets/images/indian-universities/cards-images/access to world-class resources.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Dr. Abdul Kalam International Postgraduate Scholarship" />
						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Access to World-Class Resources</h5>
                            <p>Gain access to Indo European's extensive network of international education resources, faculty exchange programs, and academic innovations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- New Zealand Commonwealth Scholarships -->
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 Indian-Students-Card">
                        <img src="~/assets/images/indian-universities/cards-images/enhanced curriculum and global exposure.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="New Zealand Commonwealth Scholarships" />
						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Enhanced Curriculum and Global Exposure</h5>
                            <p>
                                Indo European can assist in curriculum development that meets international standards, ensuring students are well-prepared for overseas education and global careers.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 Indian-Students-Card">
                        <img src="~/assets/images/indian-universities/cards-images/strengthen international presence.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="New Zealand Commonwealth Scholarships" />
						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Strengthen International Presence</h5>
                            <p>
                                Collaborating with overseas universities through Indo European's network enhances the institution's visibility and credibility on the global academic stage.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 Indian-Students-Card">
                        <img src="~/assets/images/indian-universities/cards-images/attract more students.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="New Zealand Commonwealth Scholarships" />
						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">
                                Attract More Students
                            </h5>
                            <p>
                                Offer unique overseas study opportunities, making the university a more attractive option for prospective students seeking global exposure.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 Indian-Students-Card">
                        <img src="~/assets/images/indian-universities/cards-images/faculty development.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="New Zealand Commonwealth Scholarships" />
						<div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">
                                Faculty Development
                            </h5>
                            <p>
                                Partnering with Indo European can provide opportunities for Indian university faculty to engage in international research, training, and exchange programs.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p style="color: #150958">This partnership will not only enhance the institution’s stature but also create a unique selling proposition that sets it apart from other universities.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

